{
    "title": "CDL Prep Practice Test Genie\u2122",
    "description": "Your ultimate CDL prep companion, plus an ELDT certificate, included. Accelerate your truck driving career with CDL Genie, the #1 CDL prep app. \u2028\r\n\r\nOur comprehensive CDL practice test program and ELDT theory certification ensure you'll pass your CDL test with flying colors.\u2028\r\n\r\nMeets all federal ELDT requirements:\u2028\r\n- Official FMCSA-approved training provider\u2028\r\n- Instant ELDT certificate reporting in-app\u2028\r\n- All CDL license classes (A, B, C) and endorsements included (HazMat, Passenger, Air Brakes, School Bus, Combination, Tanker, Doubles/Triples, Pre-Trip, and more)\u2028\r\n- All 1,000+ exam-like questions mirroring the actual CDL test. You won't find these questions anywhere else.\u2028\r\n- Unmatched CDL prep with industry-leading 99.06% verified pass rate\u2028\r\n- Over 80,000 drivers prepared\u2028\r\n\r\nFeatures that drive your success:\u2028\r\n- Authentic CDL Test Simulator\u2028\r\n- State-specific CDL practice test program for all 50 US states\u2028\r\n- Real-time progress tracking\u2028\r\n- Offline functionality for anytime, anywhere CDL prep\u2028\r\n- Printable PDF cheat sheets for last-minute review\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nUnlock more job opportunities and boost your earnings.\u2028Whether you're preparing for your CDL test, aiming for a CDL Class B, Class A, HazMat, or gearing up for any CDL prep, we have you covered. \r\n\r\nOur app transforms complex commercial driving rules into an easy-to-understand, focused learning experience.\u2028\r\n\r\nDon't leave your CDL prep to chance. With this app, you'll walk into your exam feeling confident and prepared. Our users consistently report that our CDL practice test questions are nearly identical to the real thing.\u2028\r\n\r\nReady to take the wheel? Download today and shift your commercial career into high gear. Your future on the road begins here!\u2028\r\n\r\nQuestions or feedback about the CDL test or the app? Contact us at info@driving-tests.org.\u2028Note: The web premium account is separate from the app, with different pricing and features.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your ultimate CDL prep companion, plus an ELDT certificate, included. Accelerate your truck driving career with CDL Genie, the #1 CDL prep app. \u2028<br><br>Our comprehensive CDL practice test program and ELDT theory certification ensure you&#39;ll pass your CDL test with flying colors.\u2028<br><br>Meets all federal ELDT requirements:\u2028<br>- Official FMCSA-approved training provider\u2028<br>- Instant ELDT certificate reporting in-app\u2028<br>- All CDL license classes (A, B, C) and endorsements included (HazMat, Passenger, Air Brakes, School Bus, Combination, Tanker, Doubles/Triples, Pre-Trip, and more)\u2028<br>- All 1,000+ exam-like questions mirroring the actual CDL test. You won&#39;t find these questions anywhere else.\u2028<br>- Unmatched CDL prep with industry-leading 99.06% verified pass rate\u2028<br>- Over 80,000 drivers prepared\u2028<br><br>Features that drive your success:\u2028<br>- Authentic CDL Test Simulator\u2028<br>- State-specific CDL practice test program for all 50 US states\u2028<br>- Real-time progress tracking\u2028<br>- Offline functionality for anytime, anywhere CDL prep\u2028<br>- Printable PDF cheat sheets for last-minute review\u2028\u2028<br><br>Unlock more job opportunities and boost your earnings.\u2028Whether you&#39;re preparing for your CDL test, aiming for a CDL Class B, Class A, HazMat, or gearing up for any CDL prep, we have you covered. <br><br>Our app transforms complex commercial driving rules into an easy-to-understand, focused learning experience.\u2028<br><br>Don&#39;t leave your CDL prep to chance. With this app, you&#39;ll walk into your exam feeling confident and prepared. Our users consistently report that our CDL practice test questions are nearly identical to the real thing.\u2028<br><br>Ready to take the wheel? Download today and shift your commercial career into high gear. Your future on the road begins here!\u2028<br><br>Questions or feedback about the CDL test or the app? Contact us at info@driving-tests.org.\u2028Note: The web premium account is separate from the app, with different pricing and features.",
